## Instructions
- Work only on this issue. Read AGENTS.md (or CLAUDE.md), the docs it points to,
  `bd show {{taskId}} --json` and the relevant code. Stay on the current branch.
- Implement the acceptance criteria and run the checks relevant to this issue.
  If already implemented, verify the existing behavior. Fix recoverable failures
  within this task; record actual evidence and distinguish fixtures from live checks.
{{#if config.autoCommit}}
- Ralph creates the Git commit after completion, outside the agent sandbox.
  Do not stage or commit from the agent. Read-only `.git` is expected.
{{else}}
- Review and commit only this task's changes locally; preserve unrelated edits.
{{/if}}

## Completion
After the acceptance checks pass, record the result in the issue notes and
append it to the end of `.ralph-tui/progress.md`, then run:
```
bd close {{taskId}} --reason "Verified result"
bd export -o .beads/issues.jsonl
```
The export lets BV link the closed issue to the implementation commit.
Only after these steps succeed, end the response with:
<promise>COMPLETE</promise>

If unfinished, record the exact remaining work in the issue notes and end without
the completion signal; Ralph reopens and retries the issue.
For a real external blocker, record the resolution needed and run
`bd update {{taskId}} --status blocked`.
Do not start another task. Keep all operations local; no push or bd sync.
